#: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh [--no-restart] "
"[path/to/package.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Installs or updates Punchi Dock Remastered from an existing .plasmoid "
"package.\n"
"Plasma Shell is restarted afterward unless --no-restart is specified.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --no-restart   Install without restarting Plasma Shell.\n"
"  --lang CODE    Override the detected language (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help     Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh"
"                                                      # Select the newest "
"universal package in dist/\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh --no-restart"
"                                         # Install without restarting the "
"desktop\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh dist/punchi-dock-"
"remastered-0.9.7-universal.plasmoid # Install an explicit package"
msgstr ""
"Usage: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh [--no-restart] "
"[path/to/package.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Installs or updates Oger Dock from an existing .plasmoid package.\n"
"Plasma Shell is restarted afterward unless --no-restart is specified.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --no-restart   Install without restarting Plasma Shell.\n"
"  --lang CODE    Override the detected language (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help     Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
